Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.06,0:00:01.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,Lost in an Ahmedabad pol?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:03.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,That's not a mistake. It's the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.48,0:00:03.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,design.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.39,0:00:06.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Each pol had one big gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.62,0:00:09.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,Shut it, and no outsider could
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.19,0:00:09.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.27,0:00:12.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,Inside: a lane, another lane,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.58,0:00:13.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,then a khadki.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:15.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,For a stranger, a maze!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,And hidden passages between
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.68,0:00:18.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,houses!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.12,0:00:19.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,In a raid, families could slip
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.99,0:00:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,out the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.28,0:00:23.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,Messages travelled roof to roof.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.69,0:00:25.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,The whole pol, like a little
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.80,0:00:26.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,fort!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.66,0:00:28.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,In 2017, this city of pols
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:29.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,became
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.27,0:00:31.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,India's first World Heritage
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,City.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:34.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,Write your pol's name in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.73,0:00:35.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.46,0:00:36.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow Otlo.
